  "Cutting, Holes & Cutouts, Polish, Edge Deletion, Mitring, Tempering, Pairing and Doubling / Lamination each have a workstation view.": "Pemotongan, Lubang & potongan, Polandia, Penghapusan tepi, MITRING, TEMPER, Pemasangan dan Pelapisan / Laminasi masing-masing memiliki tampilan stasiun kerja.",
  "Cutting, Holes & Cutouts, Polish, Edge Deletion, Mitring, Tempering, Pairing and Doubling / Lamination each have their own operational view.": "Pemotongan, Lubang & potongan, Polandia, Penghapusan tepi, MITRING, TEMPER, Pemasangan dan Pelapisan / Laminasi masing-masing memiliki pandangan operasionalnya sendiri.",
