  "Inside ProGlass Automation: proforma estimation, SGU/DGU/lamination pricing, job orders, cutting optimization, sheet store, production, delivery and reports.": "Otomatisasi ProGlass di dalam: estimasi proforma, harga SGU/DGU/laminasi, Order Kerja, pemotongan Optimasi, Gudang lembaran, produksi, pengiriman dan laporan.",
  "Installed on your machine": "Diinstal di mesin Anda",
