  "One real job, every figure": "Satu pekerjaan nyata, setiap angka",
  "One rounding rule, 1 fils tolerance, across every document": "Satu aturan pembulatan, 1 toleransi file, di setiap dokumen",
  "One row per customer with value, receivables and ageing attached.": "Satu baris per pelanggan dengan nilai, piutang, dan umur terlampir.",
