  "Price depends on the build-up, the pane sizes, the treatment, the air space, the spacer, the wastage and the sheet cost at that moment. Change the sheet price later and a spreadsheet silently re-costs last month's work.": "Harga tergantung pada penumpukan, ukuran panel, perawatan, ruang udara, spacer, limbah dan biaya lembaran pada saat itu. Ubah harga lembaran nanti dan spreadsheet akan secara diam-diam menghitung ulang biaya pekerjaan bulan lalu.",
