  "Read one module and tell us what is wrong with it. A concrete critique of the piece-flow clamping in the production stages, or of a nesting heuristic, is worth more than a generic offer to help. The repository is structured so a single module can be understood without the whole system.": "Baca satu Modul dan beri tahu kami apa yang salah dengannya. Kritik konkrit terhadap penjepitan aliran potongan dalam tahap produksi, atau terhadap heuristik bersarang, lebih berharga daripada tawaran bantuan umum. Repositori disusun sedemikian rupa sehingga satu Modul dapat dipahami tanpa keseluruhan sistem.",
