  "What the sheet cost, what the tempering cost, what the holes were charged at, what wastage to allow — held in a head, or in a notebook that only one person could read. If that person was on leave, the pricing waited.": "Berapa harga lembarannya, berapa harga TEMPER, berapa lubang yang dikenakan, berapa jumlah pemborosan yang diperbolehkan — disimpan di kepala, atau di buku catatan yang hanya bisa dibaca oleh satu orang. Jika orang itu sedang cuti, harganya menunggu.",
